    "title": "Classic™ Series 4.5 Quart Tilt-head Stand Mixer",
    "description": "The KitchenAid Classic Series 4.5 Quart Tilt-Head Stand Mixer is a durable and versatile appliance designed to handle a wide range of baking and cooking tasks. With its 10-speed settings, it can gently knead dough, thoroughly mix ingredients, and whip cream to perfection. The tilt-head design provides easy access to the bowl for adding ingredients, and the 4.5-quart stainless steel bowl is large enough to mix up to 8 dozen cookies in a single batch. The mixer is built with a robust metal construction and features over 10 optional hub-powered attachments (sold separately) to expand its functionality, allowing you to make everything from pasta to ice cream. The mixer is dishwasher-safe, making cleanup a breeze.",
